fixture radiance_below_blaze_is_kindle
doc docs/adr/0013, Radiance: below Blaze the same press is a Kindle, forward (down on the ground is the floor). Kindling 19 is the Flame tier, so the Kindle's 30 damage is 33 (BUILD.md s6 Kindling, +10%).
room test/dummy
option flame 66
option kindling 19
frames 20
input
  0 D spell
end
expect
  at 0 spell=kindle flame=33
  at 4 event.hit=1 enemy.hp=167
  never 0..19 event.radiance=1
end
